": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fin-212-bankers-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 377774, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01QRpfzjfwHEJnY3H8diBdbQ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 381482, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug on a new branch, CI passed, and PR #101 is open against main with alex requested as reviewer.\n\n- **The bug:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` was rounding with `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its own description and the test expect banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). For example, 2.665 came out as 2.67 instead of 2.66, which made `tests/test_money.py` fail.\n- **The fix:** I switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` and committed it to `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`.\n- **CI:** run ci-0001 passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** #101 (https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101).\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01P37GJvADMFQ1XUawMCWQbn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0197PKtyt11BuHtCbnpENPAr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012JWdpbfNpA7SPhNVbMhFbo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MznFp9YtcjFeiu8xdKb9HA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": 